  "about": {
    "title": "About the Phantom Forces set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Phantom Forces is a XY expansion released on 5 November 2014. It has 124 cards: 119 in the main set and 3 secret rares and 2 alternate versions. There are also 102 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 119 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (221 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 226 cards, adding the 3 secret rares and 2 alternate versions).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
